   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DIBE. Explorer 2018 KM Fish Machinery</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Key results:
Business plan for permanent establishment of KM Fish Machinery in Bangladesh in form of a service workshop and at a later stage part production.
Justification for support:
The support is granted to incentivise Danish companies to contribute to sustainable growth and employment in developing countries.
Major risks and challenges:
A major risk is that the company&#x2019;s investigations do not lead to further activities that can contribute to the realisation of the SDGs, sustainable growth and employment and responsible business conduct in accordance with the principles of the UN Global Compact and the UN guiding principles for business and human rights.</narrative>
  </description>
